1003  86BE              ; VGA text-mode test: 80x25, character plane 0, attribute plane 1.
1004  86BE              ; Uses the adapter's bank-6 text aperture (C000h-C7CFh).
1005  86BE              ; Scrolls rows 1..24 to rows 0..23, clears row 24, then verifies
1006  86BE              ; character and attribute readback through the VGA plane read map.
1007  86BE              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
1008  86BE              RunTextModeTest:
1009  86BE 21 3A 98             LD      HL,MsgTextStart
1010  86C1 CD A3 91             CALL    DebugPrint
1011  86C4 CD E2 8E             CALL    SpectrumShowTextStart
1012  86C7
